      "value": "@{5b96c4f23eff9c77a00d5a8c|full_name}: if the option is off by default then ok but I've seen far to many tos violating public avatars to see this as a good idea. I'll give an example. One of my friends found a slender Man avatar in a public world that had an animation that activated so many particals systems in it's hand that it nearly crashed me, I'm running a 2080 and a i7 7700. I had to beg him to change avatars through discord because I was unable to communicate clearly in game because of it. He is a trusted user so he would have what you are asking for for everyone.",
      "viewerReactions": null
